    "Register your interest": "登记您的意向",
    "Kenya&#39;s tea exports grew 10 per cent in 2025. China took two per cent of them.": "Kenya的茶叶出口在2025年增长了10%。中国占其中的2%。",
    "The Tea Board of Kenya&#39;s own figures show where the volume goes, and where it does not.": "Tea Board of Kenya自己的数据显示了出口量的流向,以及未流向何处。",
    "The Tea Board of Kenya published its Tea Industry Performance Report for 2025.\nThree numbers in it explain why this summit exists.": "Tea Board of Kenya发布了其2025年茶叶行业绩效报告。\n报告中的三个数字说明了本次峰会存在的原因。",
    "The headline": "headline",
    "Kenya exported 652.8 million kilogrammes of tea in 2025, up 9.81 per cent on\nthe 594.5 million kilogrammes shipped in 2024. Export earnings reached\nKES 186.91 billion, a rise of 2.87 per cent. Total marketed value came to\nKES 218.79 billion.": "Kenya在2025年出口了652.8百万千克茶叶,比2024年运出的594.5百万千克增长了9.81%。出口收入达到KES 186.91 billion,增长了2.87%。总销售额达到KES 218.79 billion。",
    "Volume grew faster than value, which is its own story about price. But the\nnumber that matters most for anyone planning a market strategy is the one\nunderneath.": "出口量增长快于出口值,这本身就说明了价格的问题。但对于任何规划市场战略的人来说,最重要的数字是下面这个。",
    "Where it goes": "流向何处",
    "Pakistan takes 36 per cent of Kenya's tea exports: 235.13 million kilogrammes,\nworth KES 73.41 billion.": "Pakistan占Kenya茶叶出口的36%:235.13百万千克,价值KES 73.41 billion。",
    "China, the largest tea market in the world, imported 13,011 tonnes of Kenyan\ntea in 2024. Against Kenya's export volume that is close to two per cent.": "中国是全球最大的茶叶市场,2024年进口了13,011吨Kenyan茶叶。相对于Kenya的出口量,这接近2%。",
    "Why concentration is a risk rather than a strength": "为什么集中是风险而非优势",
    "A buyer taking more than a third of national output is a good customer and a\nsingle point of failure at the same time. Currency moves, import policy\nchanges, a shift in domestic demand: any of these arrives as a shock to the\nwhole industry rather than to one exporter.": "一个买家占据国家产量三分之一以上,既是优质客户,也是单点故障。汇率波动、进口政策变化、国内需求转变:任何一项都会对整个行业而非单一出口商造成冲击。",
    "The usual answer is diversification, and diversification usually means finding\nbuyers who are already large. On that measure China is the obvious candidate\nand the one Kenya has reached least.": "通常的答案是多元化,而多元化通常意味着寻找已经具有规模的买家。从这个标准来看,中国是显而易见的候选者,也是Kenya触及最少的市场。",
    "What sits between access and volume": "市场准入与交易量之间的关键",
    "Market access is necessary and not sufficient. A Chinese importer buying at\nscale needs consistent grade, packaging suited to the destination channel,\ntraceability documentation, and a relationship with a supplier who answers the\nphone. Those are commercial and operational problems rather than policy ones,\nand they get solved between people rather than between governments.": "市场准入是必要但不充分条件。大规模采购的中国进口商需要稳定的等级、适合目标渠道的包装、可追溯性文件,以及与能接电话的供应商建立关系。这些是商业和运营问题而非政策问题,需要在人与人之间而非政府之间解决。",
    "That is the work of the summit. Three days in Nairobi, 21–23 April 2027, for\nproducers, exporters, importers, buyers and the investors and technology\nsuppliers around them.": "这正是峰会的工作。2027年4月21-23日在Nairobi举行三天,面向生产商、出口商、进口商、买家以及围绕他们的投资者和技术供应商。",
